Package: forceatlas2r
Title: Fast 'ForceAtlas2' Graph Layout for 'tidygraph' and 'igraph'
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mathieu", "Jacomy", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of the ForceAtlas2 algorithm and of the Gephi reference implementation"),
    person("Gephi Consortium", role = "cph",
           comment = "Reference implementation this package follows"))
Description: A compiled (C) implementation of the 'ForceAtlas2' graph layout
    algorithm of Jacomy, Venturini, Heymann and Bastian (2014)
    <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0098679>, following the reference implementation
    shipped with 'Gephi'. It supports LinLog mode, strong gravity, hub
    dissuasion, overlap prevention, edge weights, pinned nodes, the
    Barnes-Hut approximation and optional multithreading. The layout can be
    added directly to the node table of a 'tidygraph' graph, or computed as a
    coordinate matrix for 'igraph' and 'ggraph'. The layout can also be
    computed on a graphics card through 'OpenCL', which is loaded at run time
    and is not needed to install the package.
